<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 182-6 V AUSTRALIA AT TEA IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 182-6 V AUSTRALIA AT TEA IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 182 for six</p>
<p>against Australia at tea on the first day of the first test at</p>
<p>the Wanderers on Friday.</p>
</text>
